PETSELFTEST1
# V5-04 pet lines through the V2-08 sound bank: pickup says hi, a gentle
# shake giggles (a second one within 4 s stays quiet), feeding says yummy,
# going to sleep says good night (then cancelled). Gentle temperament, so
# the ids are fixed (test_sound_pack.cc). No TF pack: src=chime; with
# /sounds/default.kps on the card: src=pack. Good morning: v3_morning.
# Counted from "mark begin" (see tools/selftest_report.py).
# expect phrase_seq 211,272,241,261
# expect min:PET_PHRASE_SKIPPED 1
# expect min:PET_PHRASE_QUEUED 3
# expect none:PET_PHRASE_FAILED 0
# expect min:PET_SLEEP_CANCELLED 1
# expect none:PET_SLEEP_POWEROFF 0
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
# Quiet sounds while testing (RAM only, this boot).
volume 15
wait 20000
pet
wait 7000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 7000
hold press 1500 7000
# Only a safety net: if the cancel below were missed, the board powers
# off and this alarm wakes it 60 s later.
alarm 60
mark begin
# Pickup: hello (211). A gentle shake right after: too soon, skipped.
gesture pickup
wait 1500
gesture gentle
wait 6000
# Gentle shake again: giggle (272).
gesture gentle
wait 6000
# Rail Story(1) -> Feed(3), press: yummy (241).
tap down 2500
tap down 2500
tap press 8000
# Feed(3) -> Sleep(4), press: good night (261), then cancel in the window.
tap down 2500
tap press 8000
tap up 7000
pet
wait 4000
end
